    <bpmn:process id="W_W5010" name="W5010. Investor &amp; Shareholder Database, Targeting &amp; Ownership Intelligence" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Continuous ownership tracking; capital-markets event; targeting campaign; transaction (VS-130)
Frequency: Continuous + event-driven
Volume: ~50–100 contacts in the investor/analyst/lender universe × ownership-change events
Owner: VP Investor Relations / Treasury (VS-18)
Participants: Treasury (VS-18), Legal (VS-100), Transfer Agent (W5025/W5026), Compliance (VS-22)
Source: workflow W5010 — Investor &amp; Shareholder Database, Targeting &amp; Ownership Intelligence</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5010_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5010_Lane1" name="VP IR">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5010_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5010_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5010_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5010_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5010_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5010_Start3" name="Continuous ownership tracking; capital-markets event; targeting campaign; transaction…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5010_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5010_Task4" name="Maintain the investor/shareholder &amp; analyst database: registered and beneficial…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Maintain the investor/shareholder &amp; analyst database: registered and beneficial owners (from transfer agent W5025/W5026 and broker surveys), institutional/lender/analyst contacts, ownership concentration, and the targeting/segmentation by type (long-only, credit, ESG, retail)
Responsible (R): VP IR / Treasury / IR Analyst
Accountable (A): VP IR
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5010_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5010_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5010_Task5" name="Run ownership intelligence: track share-movements and concentration…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Run ownership intelligence: track share-movements and concentration, beneficial-ownership analysis (links W5023 related-party/beneficial-ownership disclosure), street-name vs registered, and flag threshold crossings / activist accumulation (links W5032 activist response)
Responsible (R): VP IR / Legal / Compliance
Accountable (A): VP IR
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5010_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5010_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5010_Task6" name="Target &amp; prioritize outreach: prioritize investors/analysts by fit/value, plan…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Target &amp; prioritize outreach: prioritize investors/analysts by fit/value, plan outreach (W5015), and feed the IR plan (W5009) and event calendar (W5012)
Responsible (R): VP IR / IR Analyst
Accountable (A): VP IR
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5010_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5010_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5010_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5010_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-749 (ensure controlled execution — Investor Relations Program, Shareholder Communications &amp; Capital-Markets Engagement (PA-173.1).) | - CTL-749 (ownership tracked &amp; threshold-monitored; privacy-compliant (VS-91); fair-disclosure enforced (W5017))
Owner: VP Investor Relations / Treasury (VS-18)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W5010_Assoc9" sourceRef="W5010_Annotation8" targetRef="W5010_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5010_Flow10" sourceRef="W5010_Start3" targetRef="W5010_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5010_Flow11" sourceRef="W5010_Task4" targetRef="W5010_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5010_Flow12" sourceRef="W5010_Task5" targetRef="W5010_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5010_Flow13" sourceRef="W5010_Task6" targetRef="W5010_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
