Frequency: Continuous
Volume: ~200–400 inquiries per year × audiences + proactive outreach cadence
Owner: VP Investor Relations
Participants: IR Analyst, CFO/CEO (escalation), Legal (VS-100), Treasury (VS-18), ESG (VS-25)
Source: workflow W5015 — Investor Inquiry, CRM &amp; Proactive-Outreach Response Management</bpmn:documentation>
