      <bpmn:userTask id="W5015_Task4" name="Handle inbound investor/analyst inquiries: log in the IR CRM, route to SME…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Handle inbound investor/analyst inquiries: log in the IR CRM, route to SME (treasury/ESG/legal), respond only with public/disclosed information (fair-disclosure W5017), and escalate material/significant inquiries to CFO; never disclose material non-public info
Responsible (R): VP IR / IR Analyst
Accountable (A): VP IR
Duration: Per inquiry</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5015_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5015_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
