        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Run proactive outreach: targeted investor/analyst meetings/calls (per W5010 targeting), relationship maintenance, and coverage development — on fair-disclosure basis with approved materials (W5017)
Responsible (R): VP IR / CFO
Accountable (A): VP IR
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5015_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5015_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5015_Task6" name="Capture &amp; analyze: log every interaction in CRM (W5010), capture…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Capture &amp; analyze: log every interaction in CRM (W5010), capture feedback/sentiment (W5029), and feed insights to management (W5024) and the IR plan (W5009)
Responsible (R): VP IR / IR Analyst
Accountable (A): VP IR
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5015_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
