    <bpmn:process id="W_W5016" name="W5016. ESG-Investor, Sustainable-Finance &amp; Multi-Stakeholder Investor Communications" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: ESG-reporting cycle (VS-25); sustainable-finance/investor demand; rating/index inclusion
Frequency: Annual + continuous
Volume: ~10–20 ESG-investor/agency engagements per year × reporting cycles
Owner: VP Investor Relations / ESG (VS-25) / CFO
Participants: ESG (VS-25), CSR/Foundation (VS-152), Strategy (VS-33), Legal (VS-100), Treasury (VS-18), HSE (VS-24)
Source: workflow W5016 — ESG-Investor, Sustainable-Finance &amp; Multi-Stakeholder Investor Communications</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5016_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5016_Lane1" name="VP IR">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5016_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5016_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5016_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5016_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5016_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5016_Start3" name="ESG-reporting cycle (VS-25); sustainable-finance/investor demand; rating/index inclusion">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5016_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5016_Task4" name="Manage ESG-investor &amp; rating-agency engagement: respond to ESG…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Manage ESG-investor &amp; rating-agency engagement: respond to ESG questionnaires/ratings (MSCI/Sustainalytics-equivalent, links VS-25), ESG-investor meetings (fair-disclosure W5017), and index/inclusion programs — all reconciled to the published ESG/sustainability report (VS-25) and group annual report (W5018)
Responsible (R): VP IR / ESG / IR Analyst
Accountable (A): VP IR / Head of ESG
Duration: Annual + continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5016_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5016_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5016_Task5" name="Communicate sustainable-finance &amp; stakeholder value…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Communicate sustainable-finance &amp; stakeholder value: green/sustainability-linked financing narrative (links VS-18/VS-170), community/foundation impact (links VS-152), and the multi-stakeholder (customer/employee/community/regulator) value story to investors
Responsible (R): VP IR / ESG / CSR / Treasury
Accountable (A): VP IR
Duration: Annual + continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5016_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5016_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5016_Task6" name="Govern ESG-investor disclosure: ensure ESG-investor claims are substantiated…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Govern ESG-investor disclosure: ensure ESG-investor claims are substantiated, consistent with filed ESG/sustainability disclosures (VS-25), free of greenwashing (links VS-22 compliance, VS-25), and disclosed fairly (W5017)
Responsible (R): VP IR / ESG / Legal / Compliance
Accountable (A): VP IR / Head of ESG
Duration: Annual + continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5016_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5016_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5016_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5016_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-749 (ensure controlled execution — Investor Relations Program, Shareholder Communications &amp; Capital-Markets Engagement (PA-173.1).) | - CTL-749: ESG-investor claims substantiated &amp; consistent with VS-25; fair-disclosure (W5017); greenwashing-controlled
Owner: VP Investor Relations / ESG (VS-25) / CFO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W5016_Assoc9" sourceRef="W5016_Annotation8" targetRef="W5016_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5016_Flow10" sourceRef="W5016_Start3" targetRef="W5016_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5016_Flow11" sourceRef="W5016_Task4" targetRef="W5016_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5016_Flow12" sourceRef="W5016_Task5" targetRef="W5016_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5016_Flow13" sourceRef="W5016_Task6" targetRef="W5016_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
